      "speaker_type": "official",
      "speaker_affiliation_bucket": "corporate",
      "speaker_affiliation_kind": "Berkshire Hathaway",
      "exact_quote": "\"He has, however, been generous with me. He has given me the opportunity to see Berkshire reach a point where I am more confident than ever about what lies ahead.\"",
      "attributive_verb": "wrote",
      "stance_toward_target": "for",
      "signal_text_idx": 8,
      "bucket": "QUALITY_OF_LIFE",
      "outlet": "Hindustan Times"
    },
    {
      "speaker_name": "Abel",
      "role_or_affiliation": "CEO, Berkshire Hathaway",
      "speaker_type": "official",
      "speaker_affiliation_bucket": "corporate",
      "speaker_affiliation_kind": "Berkshire Hathaway",
      "exact_quote": "\"Warren’s impact on Berkshire and its owners is without parallel in the history of American business. The culture Warren built and the values he championed will remain at the heart of Berkshire, and Howard will be their guardian. We are grateful to Howard for the care, discipline, and deep understanding of Berkshire he will bring to his new role, and to Sue Decker for her continued leadership and valued contributions as Lead Independent Director.\"",
      "attributive_verb": "said",
      "stance_toward_target": "for",
      "signal_text_idx": 8,
      "bucket": "CULTURAL",
      "outlet": "Hindustan Times"
    },
    {
